; Export list of the WCX plugin.
;
; Total Commander loads a packer plugin only when every entry point below can be
; resolved, ANSI and Unicode alike, so the whole set is listed explicitly instead
; of relying on compiler decoration rules.

EXPORTS
    OpenArchive
    OpenArchiveW
    ReadHeader
    ReadHeaderEx
    ReadHeaderExW
    ProcessFile
    ProcessFileW
    CloseArchive
    GetPackerCaps
    CanYouHandleThisFile
    CanYouHandleThisFileW
    SetChangeVolProc
    SetChangeVolProcW
    SetProcessDataProc
    SetProcessDataProcW
